# Frontend env. VITE_MOCK=1 runs the whole app on fixtures (no backend, npm run dev only).
# Set VITE_MOCK=0 + VITE_PUBLIC_API/VITE_PRIVATE_API to hit the real control plane:
#   - behind Caddy (docker compose): leave VITE_PUBLIC_API unset (same-origin /api proxy).
#   - host-run dev, no Caddy: point both at the raw uvicorn ports directly.
#     VITE_PUBLIC_API=http://localhost:8000   (browser.py)
#     VITE_PRIVATE_API=http://localhost:8010  (private_api.py)
# Team accounts don't self-register - seed them first:
#   python controlplane/seed_account.py --team-defaults
VITE_MOCK=1
# VITE_PUBLIC_API=
# VITE_PRIVATE_API=http://localhost:8010
